// [DRAFT] D718, D726 — Sister Ilvane, priestess of Samal: the Paladin's path; no oath here (it is given at the census by the gate, D727)
say|OATH_PRIEST|Samal does not ask to be looked at, child. He asks you to stand between the weak and the blow.
say|OATH_PRIEST|Whoever serves Samal is a Paladin: their strike carries light, their hands heal.
say|OATH_PRIEST|The path is chosen at the gate, when the scribe asks whom you serve. I only tell where it leads.
exit|
